## Thesis

When cognition, code generation, proof search, simulation, and planning approach abundance, scarcity moves to ground truth, admission, authority, physical/institutional consequence, independent verification, provenance, replay, energy, time, matter, and human legitimacy.

The governing loop is `O → O* → Π → μ → E → O' → V → R → learning → improved μ`. Cognition discovers patterns; admitted patterns are compiled into deterministic machinery so future cognition is spent on the unknown frontier.

